From 62b26b8ea3d4c1b4a2dba4a972cc8d31f512588e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:21:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] generic-parallel: RAJA backend

RAJA::forall with the execution policy given by the execution_policy
option, on a resource of camp, statistics in device memory, function object
not copied in the stack of each thread (configurations raja and
raja-host).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
